{"id":"5b3dd660a5b527bb","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-skyscraper-sheaves.md","title":"Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves","display":"Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves","aliases":["14-df-skyscraper-sheaves"],"display":"Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.6 equation (11), printed 93; DjVu 52","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-skyscraper-sheaves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6 equation (11), printed 93; DjVu 52"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(1=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>。用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 的预层/层签名。以下限制公式只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\tau\">\\(U,V\\in\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span> 使用；对象值与对应的带源靶限制箭头共同确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sky}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sky}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)=\\{a\\in A:x\\in U\\}\\cup\\{\\varnothing:x\\notin U\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)=\\{a\\in A:x\\in U\\}\\cup\\{\\varnothing:x\\notin U\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho^U_{\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),V}=\\{(a,a):x\\in V,\\;a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\varnothing):x\\notin V,\\;a\\in\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)\\}\\quad(V\\subseteq U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho^U_{\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),V}=\\{(a,a):x\\in V,\\;a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\varnothing):x\\notin V,\\;a\\in\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)\\}\\quad(V\\subseteq U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若覆盖中的某开集含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，相容性迫使所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的分量为同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 元素，其余分量唯一；若整个被覆开集不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，全部值都是单点。故层条件成立，即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为空也无问题。这里不假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是闭点；“集中于点”是直像层意义，不能据名字推断它在其他点的茎总为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$，$x\\in X$、$A\\in\\mathcal U$，$1=\\{\\varnothing\\}$。用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的预层/层签名。以下限制公式只对 $U,V\\in\\tau$、$V\\subseteq U$ 使用；对象值与对应的带源靶限制箭头共同确定 $\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sky}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新映射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"1=\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U,V\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sky}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)=\\{a\\in A:x\\in U\\}\\cup\\{\\varnothing:x\\notin U\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho^U_{\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),V}=\\{(a,a):x\\in V,\\;a\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\varnothing):x\\notin V,\\;a\\in\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)(U)\\}\\quad(V\\subseteq U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),X,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":1750,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves|Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves|Definition II.6 Skyscraper Sheaves]]"},{"id":"d1308b233f560aa4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$F$ 为 $(X,\\tau)$ 上的层，$x\\in X$、$A\\in\\mathcal U$。茎、摩天楼层和自然变换集合分别见 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]、[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}